{"identity_key": "bilibili:1268879617247150081", "source_id": "bilibili", "item_id": "1268879617247150081", "content": "🎉 Dark One！《TORAWASE～被囚禁的伪妃梦寐以求的幸福～》正式发售！✨首发2周8折✨\n👉Steam商店：https://store.steampowered.com/app/4215660?utm_source=bili&utm_campaign=Release\n\n✨本作特色\n・转生×性转×宫廷修罗场？\n・多选项、多结局，剧情向体验\n・细腻刻画主人公的心理变化\n・支持额外内容\n\n📖 故事简介\n未婚妻因为工作而返回日本之后，主人公开始梦到自己变成中世纪的女性。\n这样的梦反复出现，他在现实中的身体也渐渐变成女性。\n这种变化能否恢复？或者，他的人生将迎来新的转折？\n\n📌作品信息\n・原画：ベコ太郎（代表作：《牛顿与苹果树》）\n・剧本：武藤真晴（代表作：《病房轶事》）／朝凪軽（代表作：《壁妻》）\n・企画原案：LIBERTYWORKS\n\n❓ 常见问题 Q&A\nQ：如何获取本游戏的额外内容？\nA：额外内容可前往白舟官网免费下载。 https://shiravune.com/zh-cn/\n\nQ：如何反馈游戏BUG？\nA：如在游戏中遇到问题，欢迎私信或在官方Discord提出，我们将及时处理！", "publisher": "Shiravune白舟_官方", "canonical_url": "https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1268879617247150081", "published_at": "2026-11-10T01:00:58+00:00", "published_precision": "second", "fetched_at": "2026-11-13T15:27:25.426351+00:00", "media": [{"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/fb87d851d41d4a44dc4029e7fce598ad3493105997187935.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/f4e02b76404b84f5aef2f7907b836ca63493105997187935.png"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/2fc4d4910b897d87b06f92c474d09c123493105997187935.png"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/4419fd25bd8bd82026a3b7e750ff9afd3493105997187935.png"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/6d7dbc408b8b764b738a32efc1e1cbaa3493105997187935.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/720cc9c2494c9997b55177193de9145c3493105997187935.jpg"}], "metadata": {"account": "bili_3493105997187935", "uid": "3493105997187935", "dynamic_type": "DYNAMIC_TYPE_DRAW", "title": "", "is_retweet": false, "is_reply": false, "is_quote": false, "stats": {"likes": 172, "retweets": 0, "replies": 8}, "provider": "web-dynamic/feed-space", "route": "anonymous-buvid", "tag": "B站Gal"}}
{"identity_key": "bilibili:1268915982771945475", "source_id": "bilibili", "item_id": "1268915982771945475", "content": "兰斯小科普：\n《兰斯5D》的标题里，为什么偏偏加了一个“D”？[Rance系列表情_哈尼？]\n其实这里的“D”，并不是什么世界观设定，也不是某个特殊单词的缩写。\n在正式开发出《兰斯5D》之前，制作组其实已经先后做过《兰斯5A》《兰斯5B》《兰斯5C》三个方案。\n只不过，这三个版本最后都没能正式完成。\n于是，在A、B、C三个方案接连中止之后，第四个开发方案便成为了我们后来看到的《兰斯5D》。\n所以《兰斯5D》里的“D”，其实就是第四次开发方案留下来的编号。 [Rance系列表情_喝茶]", "publisher": "ALICESOFT公式", "canonical_url": "https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1268915982771945475", "published_at": "2026-11-10T03:22:05+00:00", "published_precision": "second", "fetched_at": "2026-11-13T15:27:25.426351+00:00", "media": [], "metadata": {"account": "bili_3546948824992722", "uid": "3546948824992722", "dynamic_type": "DYNAMIC_TYPE_DRAW", "title": "兰斯小科普：", "is_retweet": false, "is_reply": false, "is_quote": false, "stats": {"likes": 307, "retweets": 0, "replies": 32}, "provider": "web-dynamic/feed-space", "route": "anonymous-buvid", "tag": "B站Gal"}}
